# A release checklist whose items stopped being sections

A page that lists its conditions as prose, or under headings a level deeper than
the reader walks, is a list with nothing in it. Every leg keyed on an item then
passes by walking an empty population, which is the shape a guard exists against.

The full merge gate is green on the release commit. The coverage floor is held. The
package carries no native runtime and no model. None of those is a section.
